  "title": "Nigeria: TotalEnergies is Awarded Two Offshore Exploration Permits",
  "summary": "Paris, September 2nd, 2025 – TotalEnergies (80%, operator), together with its partner South Atlantic Petroleum (20%), have signed the Production Sharing Contract (PSC) for the PPL 2000 and PPL 2001 exploration licenses offshore Nigeria, which were awarded following the 2024 Exploration Round organized by the Nigerian Upstream Petroleum Regulatory Commission. PPL 2000 & 2001, covering […]",
